This is the main file that controls your mini market app. Think of it as the app's control center — it decides what you see on screen at any moment. It pulls together all the important pieces: your login page, the browse screen where you look at items, your shopping cart, your order history, and even a special spot for booth owners to manage things. It also brings in community features like announcements and feedback, plus helpful notifications to guide you along the way. Everything is neatly connected here so the app runs smoothly and you have the best experience whether you're browsing or selling.
